      <h2 class="CH"><a name="7.04"></a>CHAPTER 7-04<br />MUNICIPAL SOLID WASTE COLLECTION SERVICE</h2>
            <p class="digCH">SECTIONS:</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff07/Flagstaff0704000.html#7.04.001.0001">7-04-001-0001</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;SHORT TITLE</p>

