            <p class="P4">(1)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Inert Material:</p>

            <p class="P5">(a)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Landfill tipping fees may be waived or reduced for clean soil, rubble and other inert material that can be utilized for beneficial use to the landfill, as determined by the Director or designee.</p>

            <p class="P5">(b)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;If the inert material is not clean soil, rubble or other inert material, the hauler will be charged $43.00 per ton.</p>

            <p class="P3">d.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Category 4: Refuse hauled from outside the County &ndash; will be charged the EMF, other charges, plus the following fees to use the landfill:</p>

